abstract: "An ablation-driven reinforcement learning textbook available in Chinese and English, from multi-armed bandits and deep model-free reinforcement learning to offline and model-based reinforcement learning, a Decision Transformer bridge, and LLM post-training (RLHF, DPO, and GRPO/RLVR), with a 17-entry failure atlas."
